 "blueprint_proof_text": "This is the recorded classical input of the statement, Stacks Project,\nAlgebraic Curves, Lemma 53.4.1\n([Tag 0BS2](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0BS2)), part (6),\nwhich identifies the dualizing sheaf of a smooth curve of relative\ndimension one with the sheaf of Kähler differentials, together with\nLemma 53.5.2\n([Tag 0BS6](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0BS6)), parts (1)\nand (2): the dualizing sheaf is invertible and its degree is\n$-2\\chi(\\mathcal O_X)=2g-2$. The\nblueprint uses the statement in this form and gives no separate proof.",
